er launch (in the notebook before launching): commit SHA, GPU, exact argv, ≥ 1 finite optimizer step, epoch-1 time ≤ 1.05 × T_epoch of that arm's probe (on failure: stop the run, record it as `_ABORTED_slow`, and re-probe before any relaunch), `history.jsonl` per epoch, `epoch_NNN.pth` for every epoch, no resume.

